  16:     - Sort each group top-to-bottom by input row.
  17:     - Stack frames in left column (cols 0–3), solids in right (cols 4–7).
  18:     - Output is 8 wide; height = 4 × max(#frames, #solids), bg-padded.
  19: 
  20:     Key insight: Frame vs solid is determined solely by whether the 2×2 interior matches bg.
